---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const team = [
    {name: "Spencer Barrett", role: "Frontend: Sign Up Page" },
    { name: "Vineet Gupta", role: "Backend (FastAPI)" },
    { name: "Nick Garza", role: "Frontend: Blog Page" },
    { name: "Mikai Miranda", role: "Frontend: About page" },
];
---

<Layout>
    <main class="hero">
        <div class="overlay"></div>
        <div class="content gap-6">
            <h1>Blog <span>BiteSwipe</span></h1>

            <p class="text-white max-w-2xl">
                PLACEHOLDER
            </p>

            <h2>Spencer Barret</h2>
            <p class="text-white max-w-2xl">
                “This is a cool product because it helps streamline what I’m looking for.
                A lot of the time I am forced to rely on active recall to think of what food sounds good when I’m hungry.
                Google helps but doesn’t really get me. BiteSwipe helps me find food quickly based on my preferences rather than just what’s nearby.”
            </p>
            <h2>Vineet Gupta</h2>
            <p class="text-white max-w-2xl">
                PLACEHOLDER
            </p>

            <h2>Nick Garza</h2>
            <p class="text-white max-w-2xl">
                "I'm the type of person who values quality time with others. BiteSwipe allows me to stay more present when I'm out with friends
                by giving me curated suggestions. The time I would have spent searching through a sea of choices can now be spent in the moment with those around me.
                I believe the best conversations happen over great food."
            </p>

            <h2>Mikai Miranda</h2>
            <p class="text-white max-w-2xl">
                PLACEHOLDER
            </p>

            <h2>Liam Horgan</h2>
            <p class="text-white max-w-2xl">
                PLACEHOLDER
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>